ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le01ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Peter told me about your new assignment for the magazine. I think you can write an engaging piece on this subject.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I guess so. I like to keep my readers interested. I don't want them to feel bored when they read my articles. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    That's the key to a healthy relationship.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le01ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "16300", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Haha. Very true. Anyway, you're my next interviewee. Let's talk about your passion for cooking. When did it all start? When did you realize you wanted to become a chef?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    I've always loved to cook. I think I've read more cookbooks than novels in my life! When I was in primary school, I would go to the kitchen and help my mom. I used to chop vegetables for dinner and make pancakes on Sundays.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le01ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "41600", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Have you always kept a cooking diary?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Yes. I used to write down every single step of my favorite recipes. We would try them out with my friends at school. We used to make such a mess!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        That's so cool. I was a picky eater as a kid. I thought cooking was boring, too.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Well, I'm glad that has changed. We wouldn't be best friends otherwise!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le01ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le01ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type